cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the following work."
title: "Measuring Aesthetic Homogenization in Text-to-Image AI: Diversity Collapse in DALL-E 3 and Imagen 4"
abstract: "A reproducible methodology for quantifying aesthetic and cultural diversity collapse in text-to-image models, operationalizing three distributional measures (effective support radius, diversity index, effective dimension) in CLIP and DINOv2 embedding space, with an empirical study of DALL-E 3 and Imagen 4 and a controlled SDXL ablation isolating the MSE denoising objective from preference training."
